==English==

===Alternative spellings===
*[[amortise]]

===Verb===
{{en-verb|amortiz|ing}}

# {{transitive}} To [[decrease]] an [[amount]] [[gradually]] or in [[installment]]s, especially in order to [[write off]] an [[expenditure]] or [[liquidate]] a [[debt]].
#:''He obtained a mortgage with the interest payments '''amortized''' over the life of the loan.''

